      "id": "claim_c6139cbb38ed4e9ba22ba672debe752f",
      "statement": "There are two MCP gatekeepers sharing one library (packages/mcp-shared): gatekeeper-mcp where a user pastes a URL scoped to the whole server or named tools, and gatekeeper-mcp-portal where the endpoint comes from MCP_PORTAL_URL and any grant is scoped to one upstream server behind the portal or its named tools.",
