    {
      "id": "claim_95a04a87ecaf43d4bc92765b54e74958",
      "statement": "tools.ts is the trust boundary and nothing outside it reads a tool's annotations; classifyTool is the single place a server's self-description becomes a policy decision, classifying a tool as read (readOnlyHint == true), action, and autoApprovable only for a non-read action on a vetted endpoint with destructiveHint===false && idempotentHint===true.",
      "evidence": [
