    {
      "id": "claim_87409fca7a3041d799631475320a7b83",
      "statement": "A vetted endpoint is one a deployment has asserted can drive auto-approval, while byo (a user typed the URL in) lets readOnlyHint classify reads but nothing the server says can auto-apply a write; the portal defaults to byo and requires MCP_PORTAL_TRUST_ANNOTATIONS=true to drive auto-approval.",
