      "id": "claim_b1c551f588a146308839f862dcb2c152",
      "statement": "MCP approval is at most once: an approval is claimed in storage before the call is sent, the record is settled in its own small write before the result is attached, and only a 401/403 proves the tool was refused before dispatch — other failures are closed as failed and not retryable since the request may already have been carried out.",
